{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YCxcLujNgmLmHsjmy3ynU4","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"TLE9201SG\" \"pin\" \"1\" \"SO\" OR \"VSO\" \"2\" pin configuration \"DSO-12\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG Datasheet by Infineon Technologies\",\"url\":\"https://www.digikey.com/htmldatasheets/production/1896279/0/0/1/tle9201sg.html\"},{\"title\":\"Automotive Power Data Sheet Rev. 1.0, 2014-02-25 6 A H-Bridge with SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.infineon.com/assets/row/public/documents/10/49/infineon-tle9201sg-ds-en.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SGAUMA1 Infineon - Motor Drivers - Distributors, Price Comparison, and Datasheets\",\"url\":\"https://octopart.com/part/infineon/TLE9201SGAUMA1\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SGAUMA1 Infineon\",\"url\":\"https://export.rsdelivers.com/product/infineon/tle9201sgauma1/infineon-tle9201sgauma1-brushless-motor-driver-ic/1107460\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SGAUMA1 Infineon\",\"url\":\"https://in.rsdelivers.com/product/infineon/tle9201sgauma1/infineon-tle9201sgauma1-brushless-motor-driver-ic/1107460\"},{\"title\":\"Automotive Power Data Sheet Rev. 1.0, 2014-02-25 6 A H-Bridge with SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.mouser.de/datasheet/2/196/Infineon-TLE9201SG-DS-v01_00-en-776916.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Automotive Power Data Sheet Rev. 1.1, 2015-02-15 6 A H-Bridge with SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.infineon.com/assets/row/public/documents/10/49/infineon-ifx9201sg-ds-en.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon TLE9201SGAUMA1, BLDC Motor Driver IC, 28 V 6A 12-Pin, DSO-12-17\",\"url\":\"https://www.enrgtech.co.uk/product/motor-driver-ics/ET16794045/TLE9201SGAUMA1\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG footprint, schematic symbol and 3D model by Infineon\",\"url\":\"https://componentsearchengine.com/TLE9201SG/Infineon\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG - OSS-ECAL English\",\"url\":\"https://oss-ecal.com/model/tle9201sg/\"}]\n\nThe Infineon datasheet puts DIR on pin 1 and VSO on pin 2, with SO on pin 3, in the PG-DSO-12-17 package.\n\n- **Pin 1 is DIR**, the direction input that sets the motor current direction. 2 · Pin Configuration, 2.1 · Pin Assignment, Figure 1 · Pin Assignment TLE9201SG, 2.2 · Pin Definitions and Functions. Pin · Symbol · Function, 1 · DIR · Direction input to define direction of the motor current\n- **Pin 2 is VSO**, the supply pin for the SO output. Its voltage is chosen to match the desired logic level, typically 5 V or 3.3 V. 2 · VSO · Supply pin for SO output. Connect to 5V or 3.3V depending on desired logic level\n- **Pin 3 is SO**, the SPI serial output. 3 · SO · SPI serial output\n\nThe other pins are VS (4), OUT1 (5), GND (6), OUT2 (7), SI (8), CSN (9), SCK (10), DIS (11) and PWM (12). The GND pin is also connected to the heat slug. heat slug (GND)\n\nThe package is the DSO-12 variant. PG-DSO-12-17 One third-party listing gives a pin count of 15 instead of 12. That conflicts with the datasheet and the other distributor listings, so I'd trust the datasheet's 12-pin layout.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d040c4d-5f77-495d-8ec4-cf62a703d8c8","uuid":"76797aab-b51a-4342-a0cd-6155c9f972c6","timestamp":"2026-10-17T00:44:57.898Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"\"TLE9201SG\" \"pin\" \"1\" \"SO\" OR \"VSO\" \"2\" pin configuration \"DSO-12\"","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_0162ALLs61gicDKAf5dX6DZT","content":[{"title":"TLE9201SG Datasheet by Infineon Technologies","url":"https://www.digikey.com/htmldatasheets/production/1896279/0/0/1/tle9201sg.html"},{"title":"Automotive Power Data Sheet Rev. 1.0, 2014-02-25 6 A H-Bridge with SPI","url":"https://www.infineon.com/assets/row/public/documents/10/49/infineon-tle9201sg-ds-en.pdf"},{"title":"TLE9201SGAUMA1 Infineon - Motor Drivers - Distributors, Price Comparison, and Datasheets","url":"https://octopart.com/part/infineon/TLE9201SGAUMA1"},{"title":"TLE9201SGAUMA1 Infineon","url":"https://export.rsdelivers.com/product/infineon/tle9201sgauma1/infineon-tle9201sgauma1-brushless-motor-driver-ic/1107460"},{"title":"TLE9201SGAUMA1 Infineon","url":"https://in.rsdelivers.com/product/infineon/tle9201sgauma1/infineon-tle9201sgauma1-brushless-motor-driver-ic/1107460"},{"title":"Automotive Power Data Sheet Rev. 1.0, 2014-02-25 6 A H-Bridge with SPI","url":"https://www.mouser.de/datasheet/2/196/Infineon-TLE9201SG-DS-v01_00-en-776916.pdf"},{"title":"Automotive Power Data Sheet Rev. 1.1, 2015-02-15 6 A H-Bridge with SPI","url":"https://www.infineon.com/assets/row/public/documents/10/49/infineon-ifx9201sg-ds-en.pdf"},{"title":"Infineon TLE9201SGAUMA1, BLDC Motor Driver IC, 28 V 6A 12-Pin, DSO-12-17","url":"https://www.enrgtech.co.uk/product/motor-driver-ics/ET16794045/TLE9201SGAUMA1"},{"title":"TLE9201SG footprint, schematic symbol and 3D model by Infineon","url":"https://componentsearchengine.com/TLE9201SG/Infineon"},{"title":"TLE9201SG - OSS-ECAL English","url":"https://oss-ecal.com/model/tle9201sg/"}]},"The Infineon datasheet puts DIR on pin 1 and VSO on pin 2, with SO on pin 3, in the PG-DSO-12-17 package.\n\n- **Pin 1 is DIR**, the direction input that sets the motor current direction. 2 · Pin Configuration, 2.1 · Pin Assignment, Figure 1 · Pin Assignment TLE9201SG, 2.2 · Pin Definitions and Functions. Pin · Symbol · Function, 1 · DIR · Direction input to define direction of the motor current\n- **Pin 2 is VSO**, the supply pin for the SO output. Its voltage is chosen to match the desired logic level, typically 5 V or 3.3 V. 2 · VSO · Supply pin for SO output. Connect to 5V or 3.3V depending on desired logic level\n- **Pin 3 is SO**, the SPI serial output. 3 · SO · SPI serial output\n\nThe other pins are VS (4), OUT1 (5), GND (6), OUT2 (7), SI (8), CSN (9), SCK (10), DIS (11) and PWM (12). The GND pin is also connected to the heat slug. heat slug (GND)\n\nThe package is the DSO-12 variant. PG-DSO-12-17 One third-party listing gives a pin count of 15 instead of 12. That conflicts with the datasheet and the other distributor listings, so I'd trust the datasheet's 12-pin layout."],"durationSeconds":5.784917590000027,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YCxcLujNgmLmHsjmy3ynU4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
